Output docs/demo.gif

Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1000
Set Height 600
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"

Type "# MCP Dependency Doctor - Read-only npm analysis for AI agents" Sleep 500ms Enter
Sleep 1s
Enter

Type "# Check what tools are available:" Sleep 300ms Enter
Type "npx -y mcp-dependency-doctor" Sleep 500ms
Sleep 2s
Enter

Sleep 4s

Type "clear" Enter
Sleep 500ms

Type "# Four diagnostic tools:" Sleep 300ms Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "# 📦 dependency_inventory  - Parse lockfile (offline)" Sleep 300ms Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "# 🔒 dependency_audit      - Find vulnerabilities" Sleep 300ms Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "# ⬆️  dependency_outdated   - Check for updates" Sleep 300ms Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "# 💊 package_health        - Detect deprecation" Sleep 300ms Enter
Sleep 3s
